<title>INDIA: SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the preliminary</p>
<p>league match of the five-nation Nehru Gold Cup international</p>
<p>soccer tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Iraq beat Ghana 1-0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Sahib Hasan 70</p>
</text>
